# Allow-list for the shop harness image build (issue #166). Start excluded,
# then re-include only what the Dockerfile actually COPYs. Kept beside
# Dockerfile, not a root .dockerignore — the repository has none today.
*

!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!tsconfig.json
!packages/
!packages/**
!examples/shop/
!examples/shop/**
!infra/hatchet/compose.yaml
!infra/shop-harness/fly/run.sh

# Re-excluded even under a re-included directory: never ship a host build
# into the image, and never let a stale .tsbuildinfo skip the in-image build.
# Also never a .env* file: examples/shop/.env.local in the main checkout
# holds a real token and database URL.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.env*
**/.env.local
